        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, hard coal, at cogen, allocation exergy
The average allocated fuel input per heat output is about 0.96 MJ/MJ. The heat supply of this technology in the region is at about 4200 PJ based on IEA. NA; UUID: f46f391d-a40b-3d83-9e1b-030640c467d3
Heat output at the plant gate. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 
Location: CN in 2019
Technology: Average installed technology.
Time period: 
Production volume: 4200 PJ
Sampling: Databases/ literature data based on regional statistics.
Extrapolations: No relevant extrapolations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f46f391d-a40b-3d83-9e1b-030640c467d3.xml</text>
